*.obj
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
# CMake build trees. They are called build, build-release, build-engine-05a and so
# on, one per experiment, and each holds hundreds of files and megabytes of
# objects. None of it is source, so the pattern is deliberately wide: a new
# directory name must not become untracked noise that `git status` reports as
# project content.
build*/
